Keyboard sounds in this folder (mx-blue, mx-brown, mx-red)

These are real recordings of Cherry MX Blue, Brown and Red switches with ABS
keycaps, cut from the "CherryMX Blue/Brown/Red - ABS keycaps" sound packs of the
Mechvibes project: https://github.com/hainguyents13/mechvibes
(soundpacks/keyboard/cherrymx-{blue,brown,red}-abs/sound.ogg).

Each file is one key's press from that pack's sprite (keys A, S, D, F, J, K, L,
E, Space, Enter, Backspace), cut by scripts/cut-keyboard-sounds.mjs: it starts
1 ms before the attack, is at most 120 ms long with a 10 ms fade-out, is matched
in loudness, and is 44.1 kHz 16-bit mono WAV. They are used under the Mechvibes licence:

